!.env.example
# Committed on purpose: holds the PRODUCTION api/web URLs that every `eas update`
# must bundle. Contains no secrets (EXPO_PUBLIC_* values ship in the JS bundle
# anyway). Without it, a local staging override in .env leaks into an OTA build.
!.env.production

